183
00:17:52,792 --> 00:17:54,667
- [ Peter ] She 's crazy , and you know it . - Enough of this .

184
00:17:54,750 --> 00:17:58,208
- Both of you , get out of here . - Okay , Officer . Okay . Anything you say .

185
