Come on , sweetie pie .

186
00:18:03,375 --> 00:18:04,417
Good night , Officer .

187
00:18:05,125 --> 00:18:07,708
Yeah . Out of my sight .

188
00:18:08,333 --> 00:18:10,083
Good night .

189
00:18:10,167 --> 00:18:12,833
" To my daughter Anne , in case anything should happen to me .

190
00:18:12,917 --> 00:18:17,042
Due to my morbid curiosity , I have managed to contract a strange disease ,

191
00:18:17,125 --> 00:18:19,750
