192
00:18:19,833 --> 00:18:23,708
But I know I 'll never leave this island again , at least not alive .

193
00:18:23,792 --> 00:18:28,042
I haven 't been a good father , but I have always loved you . One last kiss from Dad . "

194
00:18:28,125 --> 00:18:31,167
Matool . And it 's dated 15 September .

195
00:18:32,708 --> 00:18:33,708
Listen , Chief . You know ,

196
