215
00:20:08,833 --> 00:20:12,208
Do you wanna check on the boat first or shall we go straight to the hotel ?

216
00:20:12,292 --> 00:20:14,375
I don 't know . Whatever you think .

217
00:20:14,458 --> 00:20:18,208
Senor , do you know anyone who can rent us a boat ?

218
00:20:18,292 --> 00:20:19,750
Boat , señor ?

219
