231
00:21:07,667 --> 00:21:09,375
Oh , sure . Yes .

232
00:21:09,458 --> 00:21:12,458
- There you are . Thanks again . - Gracias . Gracias .

233
00:21:29,667 --> 00:21:31,917
Extra water . Store it in the galley .

234
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:33,500
Aye , aye , sir .

235
00:21:38,583 --> 00:21:39,792
